title: RentDay_Start
tags:
---
<<wait_for_action pick_up_rent_envelope>>
landlord: (knocks) Seventh of the month. You know why I am here.
landlord: Four-eighty. Not tomorrow. Today.
<<player_choose>>
-> Pay now from the Rent envelope.
    <<jump RentDay_PayOnTime>>
-> "Not today. Can it wait one day?"
    <<jump RentDay_PayLate>>
-> "I forgot which envelope had it."
    landlord: I am old. My patience is older. Find it.
    <<wait_for_action open_drawer>>
    <<jump RentDay_PayOnTime>>
===

title: RentDay_PayOnTime
tags:
---
<<wait_for_action hand_over_cash 480>>
landlord: One moment. (counts) Four-eighty. Done.
landlord: You know why I come on the seventh and not the tenth?
landlord: By the tenth, the money has small legs. It walks.
<<player_choose>>
-> "I paid before I spent. That's why it was still here."
    landlord: That is the only secret. Rent first. Always.
    <<set_flag paid_rent_on_time>>
-> "Sensei Wren told me to keep it separate."
    landlord: She is a wise one. Listen to her.
    <<set_flag paid_rent_on_time>>
<<continue>>
landlord: Receipt. Keep it. Always take a receipt.
<<wait_for_action receive_receipt>>
<<grant_mastery budgeting.rent-timing 1>>
<<set_flag finished_rent_day>>
maya-didi: See? Boring. Boring is the best feeling on rent day.
===

title: RentDay_PayLate
tags:
---
landlord: One day. Tomorrow morning. Four-eighty.
landlord: No interest. This time. Because you are new.
landlord: But I will remember. Memory is a landlord's job.
<<set_flag rent_paid_late_once>>
<<wait_for_action sleep_one_night>>
maya-didi: Morning. The Lender is already on the staircase.
maya-didi: Here is the trick I learned. Pay rent on day one of your paycheck.
maya-didi: Not day seven. Not day six. Day one.
<<wait_for_action hand_over_cash 480>>
landlord: (sighs) Done. But fix this pattern.
<<player_choose>>
-> "I'll pay on day one next month."
    maya-didi: Good. Move the Rent envelope to the top of the drawer.
    <<set_flag will_pay_rent_first>>
-> "Same money. Just one day later."
    maya-didi: Same money. Different feeling. Late starts a habit.
    maya-didi: Habits are heavier than the money inside them.
    <<set_flag will_pay_rent_first>>
<<continue>>
<<grant_mastery budgeting.rent-timing 1>>
<<set_flag finished_rent_day>>
maya-didi: You didn't lose money. You learned the lesson cheap. Use it.
===
